{"channelId":"UCNHouTWvYEqQEANSHA7edLw","row":["Dawg Squad",35,"The Dawg Squad is an all-volunteer animal rescue working in the Los Angeles area. We rescue at-risk animals focusing on homeless and abandoned dogs providing medical care, rehabilitation and loving foster homes until a permanent, adoptive homes can be found. \r\n\r\nAll animals are spayed, neutered and microchipped prior to adoption.\r\nTo date we have rescued and placed over 1100+ animals in loving homes.\r\n\r\nThe Dawg Squad is an all-volunteer organization. It has no paid employees or salaried officers.  We do not have an  expensive shelter facility; we foster every animal in volunteers' homes or approved kennels before finding homes.","dawgsquad@rocketmail.com",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNHouTWvYEqQEANSHA7edLw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNHouTWvYEqQEANSHA7edLw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:10.661Z","channelId":"UCNHouTWvYEqQEANSHA7edLw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"525f0ae32d127585387e70ebeb75de4136e50bb393c8aa752410005d3ca2135c","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"b935de4e7fa7aa7baed12eb8cbe696b7dae1f3085b52a1740ce3a571f6f3fe6e"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNHouTWvYEqQEANSHA7edLw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":35,"raw":"35 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNHouTWvYEqQEANSHA7edLw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:10.661Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"dawgsquad@rocketmail.com","purpose":"general","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"channel_published","sourceUrls":["https://dawgsquad.org/contact/"],"evidenceIds":["public-page:160afbcd1ed1f99ffefd29d8"],"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:42:01.847Z","deliveryVerified":false,"dnsStatus":"unknown","context":"页面原文: you can contact us at dawgsquad@rocketmail.com\nHTML href: mailto:dawgsquad@rocketmail.com","raw":"dawgsquad@rocketmail.com"}],"co